      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这里下午真安静。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "所以我有时候来这里看书。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你最近在看什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "一本关于旅行的书，不难，很轻松。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我很久没认真看书了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你平时都看手机，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，手机方便，但是很容易分心。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "看书的时候可以把手机放远一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我如果每天看十页，会不会太少？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不少，重要的是每天都看一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我想找一本简单的中文书。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以先看短故事，比较容易。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "遇到不认识的字怎么办？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先猜意思，真的看不懂再查。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样不会一直停下来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，读得顺一点儿更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，今天我先看二十分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc017_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我也看我的书，二十分钟以后再聊天。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
